<title>USA: Coltec says unit buys Signum assets.</title>
<headline>Coltec says unit buys Signum assets.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coltec Industries Inc said Monday a unit of its Garlock Sealing Technologies subsidiary has bought the assets of Signum Manufacturing Co from Virginia Sealing Products Inc.</p>
<p>A Coltec spokesman said terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Coltec said the unit that bought the assets is called Garlock Metallic Gaskets.</p>
<p>Coltec said Signum's machinery is being moved from Virginia Sealing Product's facility in Prince George, Va. to the Garlock Metallic Gaskets plant in Houston.</p>
</text>
